                "end_index": 1126,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "* **Poori Masala:** To achieve the signature velvety, glossy, \"hotel-style\" gravy, a small amount of **besan (gram flour) slurry** (besan dissolved in a little water) is stirred in and boiled"
